<Slide style={{ background: '#F5F1E6', padding: '48px 64px', fontFamily: '宋体' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end', height: 72 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>前人怎么写它</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>环节三 · 任务二</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1F3A34' }}>为你选的词找一条前人写过的句子，再说出这一首里它变在了哪里。</Text>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, marginTop: 24, height: 300 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, border: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.35)', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34' }}>前人怎么写</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>哪一首？什么处境？</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, border: '1px solid rgba(180,85,45,0.45)', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B4552D' }}>这一首变在哪</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>说出那个字。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 20 }}>“代表凄凉”不算答案——要说出是谁写的、写的什么。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, marginTop: 12, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(31,58,52,0.2)', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 8 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>《声声慢》· 李清照</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#B4552D' }}>09/16</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>